
ZN Layer Cake - Qualcomm PPE Compatible

This script is based on the upstream SQM layer_cake.qos script.

Features:
- CAKE queue management for upload and download traffic.
- DiffServ-based traffic prioritization.
- IFB-based ingress shaping.
- Preserves the original SQM Cake configuration and bandwidth settings.
- Reapplies Qualcomm PPE hardware QoS classifiers after SQM recreates WAN ingress.

ZN PPE QoS integration:
- Restores PPE flower classifiers after SQM ingress setup.
- Keeps SQM ingress redirect at priority 10.
- Does not change PPE DSCP mappings or hardware queue configuration.
- Supports qca-ppe and qcom_ppe driver detection.

Designed for ZN-M2-WIRED.

Note:
PPE hardware QoS rules are managed by the qca-ppe-qos service.
